you're about to frame up.

00:02:55.017 --> 00:02:56.163
So who are you?

00:02:56.163 --> 00:02:57.829
And then, what's this book about?

00:02:57.829 --> 00:02:58.662
- Yeah.

00:02:58.662 --> 00:03:00.606
So for me, entrepreneur, author,

00:03:00.606 --> 00:03:01.874
and I like giving back.

00:03:01.874 --> 00:03:02.721
So I say philanthropists,

00:03:02.721 --> 00:03:03.981
