00:04:55.101 --> 00:04:56.984
- Dizzy, feeling like shit.

00:04:56.984 --> 00:04:58.433
- I told my boss, "Hey, I
need to go get some coffee."

00:04:58.433 --> 00:04:59.916
I made a beeline to the nearest church

00:04:59.916 --> 00:05:01.601
cause graduated from
Seton Hall University.

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:03.413
So I was kind of trained in a crisis

00:05:03.413 --> 00:05:04.554
