00:05:04.554 --> 00:05:05.387
- [Gary] Interesting.

00:05:05.387 --> 00:05:06.882
So I'm sitting on the church steps

00:05:06.882 --> 00:05:08.194
balling my eyes out

00:05:08.194 --> 00:05:09.067
