00:05:27.061 --> 00:05:28.427
- [Marie] Okay. (laughs)

00:05:28.427 --> 00:05:29.260
- I'm going very nerdy

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:30.093
Seton Hall Basketball

00:05:30.093 --> 00:05:30.926
- [Marie] Oh!

00:05:30.926 --> 00:05:32.050
of your era
- [Marie] Yes.

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:33.225
- You clearly did not go

00:05:33.225 --> 00:05:34.158
- [Marie] I didn't.

00:05:34.158 --> 00:05:35.698
- Deep enough into the pirates

00:05:35.698 --> 00:05:36.531
- [Marie] I didn't.

00:05:36.531 --> 00:05:37.364
- from '94 to '98.

00:05:37.364 --> 00:05:38.197
[Marie] Listen.

00:05:38.197 --> 00:05:39.030
- I'm very mad right now.

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:39.863
- [Marie] So here's what I was doing.

00:05:39.863 --> 00:05:40.722
