00:06:22.918 --> 00:06:23.751
"and it's all going to come together."

00:06:23.751 --> 00:06:24.584
- [Gary] I love that.

00:06:24.584 --> 00:06:26.092
So that permission slip, for me,

00:06:26.092 --> 00:06:27.342
sent me on an odyssey to figure out

00:06:27.342 --> 00:06:28.378
who the hell I was

00:06:28.378 --> 00:06:29.527
