00:06:29.527 --> 00:06:31.145
All I knew was that I was highly creative

00:06:31.145 --> 00:06:32.364
and I also love business.

00:06:32.364 --> 00:06:33.343
But those two things

00:06:33.343 --> 00:06:34.653
didn't seem to mesh back then.

00:06:34.653 --> 00:06:36.638
Like I originally wanted to be an animator

00:06:36.638 --> 00:06:37.471
for Disney

00:06:37.471 --> 00:06:39.137
- [Gary] I understand.
- or a fashion designer.

00:06:39.137 --> 00:06:40.385
And I also loved,

00:06:40.385 --> 00:06:41.369
my dad was a small business owner,

00:06:41.369 --> 00:06:43.021
I loved the way he treated his customers.

00:06:43.021 --> 00:06:44.071
It was a printing business.

00:06:44.071 --> 00:06:46.611
I would go in weekends
and night to work with him

00:06:46.611 --> 00:06:48.625
and just loved his work ethic.

00:06:48.625 --> 00:06:50.315
That's what inspired me.

00:06:50.315 --> 00:06:52.042
So I tried magazine publishing.

00:06:52.042 --> 00:06:53.561
I was in Cadenas Publications

00:06:53.561 --> 00:06:54.638
