00:06:54.638 --> 00:06:55.808
I was like, "Okay. This is new.

00:06:55.808 --> 00:06:56.862
"This is amazing."

00:06:56.862 --> 00:06:58.879
Six months in, those voices came back

00:06:58.879 --> 00:07:00.441
