you are meant to do."

00:07:00.441 --> 00:07:01.274
And I started panicking

00:07:01.274 --> 00:07:02.432
cause felt like I was a loser.

00:07:02.432 --> 00:07:03.932
I was like I'm so ambitious.

00:07:03.932 --> 00:07:04.930
I want to make money.

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:05.978
I want to make a difference,

00:07:05.978 --> 00:07:07.791
but I fucking hate what I'm doing.

00:07:07.791 --> 00:07:08.624
And I looked ahead.

00:07:08.624 --> 00:07:10.737
I said, "Do I want to
actually be the publisher?

00:07:10.737 --> 00:07:12.423
Like "Do I want to climb
this corporate ladder?"

00:07:12.423 --> 00:07:13.689
No.

